<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
body{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a2634;margin:0;padding:40px}
.logo{text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid #194445;padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:24px}
.logo-name{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445;letter-spacing:8px}
.logo-sub{font-size:9px;color:#7a9898;margin-top:4px}
h2{color:#194445;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;border-bottom:1px solid #d4eaeb;padding-bottom:6px;margin-top:20px}
.row{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-bottom:8px}
.fld{flex:1} .fl{font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#7a9898}
.fv{font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445}
.box{background:#f0f6f6;border:1px solid #d4eaeb;padding:14px;margin:16px 0;border-radius:4px}
.br{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:11px}
.bt{font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#194445;border-top:1px solid #194445;padding-top:6px;margin-top:6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.terms{font-size:9.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5a7070;margin-top:20px}
.sigs{margin-top:50px;display:flex;gap:60px}
.sig{flex:1;border-top:1px solid #194445;padding-top:6px;font-size:9px;color:#7a9898}
.foot{margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;padding-top:8px;font-size:8.5px;color:#9aafaf;text-align:center}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="logo">
  <div class="logo-name">V I D A</div>
  <div class="logo-sub">VIDA Finance SOFOM E.N.R. &middot; RFC: {{sofomRfc}}</div>
  <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:9px;color:#7a9898">CONTRATO DE CR&Eacute;DITO PERSONAL CON DESCUENTO V&Iacute;A N&Oacute;MINA</div>
</div>
<div class="row" style="margin-bottom:16px">
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Folio</div><div class="fv">{{loanId}}</div></div>
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Emisi&oacute;n</div><div class="fv">{{issuedDate}}</div></div>
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Vencimiento</div><div class="fv">{{dueDate}}</div></div>
</div>
<h2>Acreditado</h2>
<div class="row">
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Nombre</div><div class="fv">{{employeeName}}</div></div>
  <div class="fld"><div class="fl">Empresa</div><div class="fv">{{employerName}}</div></div>
</div>
<h2>Condiciones del cr&eacute;dito</h2>
<div class="box">
  <div class="br"><span>Monto del cr&eacute;dito</span><span>${{amount}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="br"><span>Comisi&oacute;n (30%)</span><span>${{fee}} MXN</span></div>
  <div class="br"><span>Plazo</span><span>30 d&iacute;as</span></div>
  <div class="br" style="font-size:9px;color:#7a9898"><span>CAT (Costo Anual Total)</span><span>{{cat}}% anual</span></div>
  <div class="bt"><span><strong>Total a reembolsar</strong></span><span><strong>${{total}} MXN</strong></span></div>
</div>
<p style="font-size:10px">El acreditado autoriza el descuento v&iacute;a n&oacute;mina de ${{total}} MXN en la fecha de vencimiento.</p>
<h2>T&eacute;rminos</h2>
<div class="terms">
<p>1. Rige la LGTOC y dem&aacute;s ordenamientos aplicables.</p>
<p>2. Intereses moratorios: 1.5% mensual sobre saldo insoluto por incumplimiento.</p>
<p>3. El acreditado autoriza consulta ante Sociedades de Informaci&oacute;n Crediticia.</p>
<p>4. Controversias ante tribunales competentes de la Ciudad de M&eacute;xico.</p>
<p>5. Aclaraciones: CONDUSEF 01800 999 8080 &mdash; www.condusef.gob.mx</p>
</div>
<div class="sigs">
  <div class="sig">VIDA Finance SOFOM E.N.R.<br>Representante legal</div>
  <div class="sig">{{employeeName}}<br>Acreditado &mdash; Aceptaci&oacute;n digital</div>
</div>
<div class="foot">VIDA Finance SOFOM E.N.R. &middot; {{sofomAddress}} &middot; contacto@vidafinance.mx &middot; CONDUSEF 01800 999 8080</div>
</body>
</html>
